                                                      Table "public.task_comments"
   Column   |           Type           | Collation | Nullable |      Default      | Storage  | Compression | Stats target | Description 
------------+--------------------------+-----------+----------+-------------------+----------+-------------+--------------+-------------
 id         | uuid                     |           | not null | gen_random_uuid() | plain    |             |              | 
 task_id    | uuid                     |           | not null |                   | plain    |             |              | 
 content    | text                     |           | not null |                   | extended |             |              | 
 author_id  | uuid                     |           | not null |                   | plain    |             |              | 
 created_at | timestamp with time zone |           | not null | now()             | plain    |             |              | 
 updated_at | timestamp with time zone |           | not null | now()             | plain    |             |              | 
Indexes:
    "task_comments_pkey" PRIMARY KEY, btree (id)
    "idx_task_comments_task" btree (task_id, created_at DESC)
Foreign-key constraints:
    "task_comments_author_id_fkey" FOREIGN KEY (author_id) REFERENCES profiles(id) ON DELETE RESTRICT
    "task_comments_task_id_fkey" FOREIGN KEY (task_id) REFERENCES tasks(id) ON DELETE CASCADE
Policies:
    POLICY "task_comments_insert" FOR INSERT
      WITH CHECK (((author_id = uid()) AND (EXISTS ( SELECT 1
   FROM tasks t
  WHERE ((t.id = task_comments.task_id) AND is_project_member(t.project_id))))))
    POLICY "task_comments_select" FOR SELECT
      USING ((EXISTS ( SELECT 1
   FROM tasks t
  WHERE ((t.id = task_comments.task_id) AND is_project_member(t.project_id) AND (is_project_admin_or_mod(t.project_id) OR (t.assigned_user_id = uid()) OR (t.assigned_company_id = current_company_id()) OR (t.created_by = uid()))))))
    POLICY "task_comments_update_self" FOR UPDATE
      USING ((author_id = uid()))
      WITH CHECK ((author_id = uid()))
Triggers:
    trg_task_comments_updated_at BEFORE UPDATE ON task_comments FOR EACH ROW EXECUTE FUNCTION set_updated_at()
Access method: heap

